    "quote": "Manufacturers must report any thermal incident involving fire, smoke, uncontrolled overheating, injury, or property damage to the relevant regulator within 5 business days of learning of it. An incident involving death, serious injury, or an ongoing hazard must be reported within 24 hours. Manufacturers must notify affected customers within 5 business days when an incident indicates a material safety risk for their unit or model, and promptly provide safety instructions."
