    "feasibility_escape": "escape_with_alternative",
    "quote": "All new home battery models must provide a remote emergency shut-off capability that can be activated by the customer and, when necessary to address an imminent safety hazard, by the manufacturer or emergency responders. For units already installed when this standard is adopted, manufacturers must enable remote shut-off where supported and offer a retrofit or equivalent risk-reduction measure for other units within 6 years."
   },
