    "serious_injury_recall": null,
    "quote": "If any model exceeds 8 thermal incidents per 100,000 installed units in a year, the manufacturer must promptly notify regulators and affected customers and initiate a recall, including communicating recall instructions and remedies directly to affected customers. The trigger is assessed separately for each model."
